<p>The core theme of this issue of The Economist is an interesting one — &ldquo;Rebalancing the World&rdquo; — but after finishing the whole magazine, the picture that popped into my head was something else entirely: a mahjong table with four players. One has just won a big hand, one is still bitterly waiting to draw the winning tile, one is counting tiles, and one is getting ready to flip the table and walk away.</p>]]></description></item><item><title>The Economist, November 2025: Global Trends and Geopolitics</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/economist-202511-global-analysis/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Sep 2025 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author><name>ByF</name></author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/en/economist-202511-global-analysis/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
